ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.5.1 print48–49/PDF60–61; equality-free tautology branch"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; equality qualification repaired; full proof not independently reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c0c477fb00da36dd\" href=\"?note=c0c477fb00da36dd\" title=\"72-df-herbrand-expansion\">72-df-herbrand-expansion</a> 的非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\exists x_0\\cdots\\exists x_{n-1}\\psi\">\\(\\varphi=\\exists x_0\\cdots\\exists x_{n-1}\\psi\\)</span> 是闭合句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 无量词且不含等号原子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 互异。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}\">\\(\\operatorname{Valid}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropValid}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropValid}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>；有限非空析取按项次序左结合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}(\\varphi)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in(\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma^n)^k\\ \\operatorname{PropValid}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{i&lt;k}\\psi[\\vec t_i/\\vec x]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Valid}(\\varphi)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in(\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma^n)^k\\ \\operatorname{PropValid}\\!\\left(\\bigvee_{i&lt;k}\\psi[\\vec t_i/\\vec x]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源§2.5.1明确区分带逻辑相等的quasitautology与无等号tautology。旧无条件版本为假：∃x(x=x)有效，但把每个t=t视独立命题字母时任何有限析取都非重言式。现恢复源定理的无等号分支；带等号版本须把有限等号公理实例加入命题前提，不能沿用此PropValid。完整Herbrand论证的陈述及适用条件已核对，未独立重建源证明全部步骤。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-herbrand-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"c0c477fb00da36dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-herbrand-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的 $\\Sigma$ 与 [[72-df-herbrand-expansion]] 的非空 $\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma$。$\\varphi=\\exists x_0\\cdots\\exists x_{n-1}\\psi$ 是闭合句，$\\psi$ 无量词且不含等号原子；$x_i$ 互异。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-herbrand-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"c0c477fb00da36dd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的 $\\Sigma$ 与 